{"text":"kuruntokai","n":37,"lines":["நசைபெரி துடையர் நல்கலு நல்குவர்","பிடிபசி களைஇய பெருங்கை வேழம்","மென்சினை யாஅம் பொளிக்கும்","அன்பின தோழியவர் சென்ற வாறே"],"tr":["nacaiperi tuṭaiyar nalkalu nalkuvar","piṭipaci kaḷaiiya peruṅkai vēḻam","meṉciṉai yāam poḷikkum","aṉpiṉa tōḻiyavar ceṉṟa vāṟē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"பாலைபாடிய பெருங்கடுங்கோ","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Pālaipāṭiya Peruṅkaṭuṅkō"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நசைபெரி","tr":"nacaiperi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நசை","tr":"nacai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரி","tr":"peri"}]},{"text":"துடையர்","tr":"tuṭaiyar","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துடை","tr":"tuṭai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"நல்கலு","tr":"nalkalu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலு","tr":"kalu"}]},{"text":"நல்குவர்","tr":"nalkuvar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவர்","tr":"kuvar"}]}],[{"text":"பிடிபசி","tr":"piṭipaci","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பிடி","tr":"piṭi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசி","tr":"paci"}]},{"text":"களைஇய","tr":"kaḷaiiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"களை","tr":"kaḷai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]},{"text":"பெருங்கை","tr":"peruṅkai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெருங்","tr":"peruṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"}]},{"text":"வேழம்","tr":"vēḻam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழம்","tr":"ḻam"}]}],[{"text":"மென்சினை","tr":"meṉciṉai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சினை","tr":"ciṉai"}]},{"text":"யாஅம்","tr":"yāam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அம்","tr":"am"}]},{"text":"பொளிக்கும்","tr":"poḷikkum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொளிக்","tr":"poḷik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]}],[{"text":"அன்பின","tr":"aṉpiṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பின","tr":"piṉa"}]},{"text":"தோழியவர்","tr":"tōḻiyavar","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழிய","tr":"ḻiya"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வர்","tr":"var"}]},{"text":"சென்ற","tr":"ceṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"வாறே","tr":"vāṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"நசை","parts":[{"text":"நசை","lemma":"நசை","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire"},{"surface":"பெரிது","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"greatly"}],"gloss":"greatly"},{"surface":"உடையர்","parts":[{"text":"உடையர்","lemma":"உடையர்","gloss":"he has"}],"gloss":"he has"},{"surface":"நல்கலும்","parts":[{"text":"நல்கல்","lemma":"நல்கல்","gloss":"bestowing grace"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"bestowing grace also"},{"surface":"நல்குவர்","parts":[{"text":"நல்குவர்","lemma":"நல்கு","gloss":"he will bestow"}],"gloss":"he will bestow"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிடி","parts":[{"text":"பிடி","lemma":"பிடி","gloss":"female elephant"}],"gloss":"female elephant"},{"surface":"பசி","parts":[{"text":"பசி","lemma":"பசி","gloss":"hunger"}],"gloss":"hunger"},{"surface":"களைஇய","parts":[{"text":"களைஇய","lemma":"களை","gloss":"to remove"}],"gloss":"to remove"},{"surface":"பெருங்கை","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"greatness"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"trunk"}],"gloss":"large-trunked"},{"surface":"வேழம்","parts":[{"text":"வேழம்","lemma":"வேழம்","gloss":"male elephant"}],"gloss":"male elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மென்சினை","parts":[{"text":"மென்மை","lemma":"மென்மை","gloss":"softness"},{"text":"சினை","lemma":"சினை","gloss":"branch"}],"gloss":"tender-branched"},{"surface":"யாஅம்","parts":[{"text":"யாஅம்","lemma":"யா","gloss":"yā tree"}],"gloss":"yā tree"},{"surface":"பொளிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பொளிக்கும்","lemma":"பொளி","gloss":"will strip"}],"gloss":"will strip"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்பின","parts":[{"text":"அன்பு","lemma":"அன்பு","gloss":"love"},{"text":"இன","lemma":"இன","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing love"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"சென்ற","parts":[{"text":"சென்ற","lemma":"செல்","gloss":"that went"}],"gloss":"that went"},{"surface":"வாறே","parts":[{"text":"வாறு","lemma":"வாறு","gloss":"way"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the path indeed"}]}],"literal":"Desire greatly he has, bestowing grace also he will bestow / female elephant's hunger to remove, the big-trunked male elephant / tender-branched yā tree will strip / full of love, O friend, is the path he went!","translation":"He has great love for you, and he will surely return to bestow his grace. O friend, on the path he has taken, a great-trunked male elephant strips the tender bark of the yā tree to appease the hunger of its female mate. Such is the loving nature of the path he travels.","modern":"தோழியே! அவர் உன் மீது மிகுந்த அன்பு உடையவர்; உனக்கு அருள் செய்யவும் செய்வார். பெண் யானையின் பசியைப் போக்குவதற்காக, பெரிய துதிக்கையையுடைய ஆண் யானையானது மெல்லிய கிளைகளையுடைய யா மரத்தின் பட்டையை உரித்து ஊட்டும். அத்தகைய அன்புடைய காட்சிகளைக் கொண்ட வழியில்தான் அவர் சென்றுள்ளார்.","explanation":"The friend (தோழி) is speaking to the heroine (தலைவி) to comfort her during the hero's absence in the harsh desert (பாலை) landscape. She assures the heroine that the hero is full of love and will return soon. To ease her anxiety, the friend describes the path he is traveling, where a large-trunked male elephant strips the bark of a tender-branched yā tree to feed its hungry female mate. This image of tender care in a dry desert serves as an implied metaphor (uḷḷuṟai uvamam), suggesting that the hero, witnessing such love in nature, will be reminded of his own love and hasten back. Key words include 'நசை' (desire/love), 'பிடி' (female elephant), 'வேழம்' (male elephant), and 'யாஅம்' (yā tree).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.57],[0.57,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,2.7],[2.7,3.4],[3.4,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,5.33],[5.33,6.1],[6.1,6.6],[6.6,7.37],[7.37,8.32],[8.32,8.9],[8.9,9.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.63],[0.63,1.3],[1.3,1.72],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.3],[3.3,4.0],[4.0,4.6],[4.6,4.8],[4.8,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.5],[7.5,8.27],[8.27,9.23],[9.23,9.8],[9.8,10.2]]},"sync":[[["நசை","desire"],["பெரிது","greatly"]],[["பெரிது","greatly"],["உடையர்","he has"]],[["நல்கலும்","bestowing grace also"]],[["நல்குவர்","he will bestow"]],[["பிடி","female elephant"],["பசி","hunger"]],[["களைஇய","to remove"]],[["பெருங்கை","large-trunked"]],[["வேழம்","male elephant"]],[["மென்சினை","tender-branched"]],[["யாஅம்","yā tree"]],[["பொளிக்கும்","will strip"]],[["அன்பின","possessing love"]],[["தோழி","O friend"],["அவர்","he"]],[["சென்ற","that went"]],[["வாறே","the path indeed"]]]}